{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drug Life: Gangster Simulator</strong> puts you in the heart of the <i>underground drug trade.</i> Build your empire by growing weed, delivering shipments, and expanding your influence across <i><strong>rival gang territories.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage risky deals, upgrade your vehicles for larger deliveries, and fight to control districts dominated by hostile gangs. <i><strong>Each territory you conquer unlocks new opportunities</strong></i> \u2013 but keeping control requires constant hustle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re striking deals, defending your depots, or waging turf wars, every decision shapes your rise to the top of the criminal underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968650/extras/2c20de7c92a4daa563fe93289b399d05.avif?t=1757351282\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Start in an abandoned bunker with nothing; make your first production, hit the streets, supply special clients with different types and qualities of weed, and climb step by step in the criminal underworld by building your reputation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968650/extras/09c59afb1f4545d1e8dbf21ea05461d8.avif?t=1757351282\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Assign your workers to the warehouses, and they will take over production for you, keeping your stocks filled.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968650/extras/d8374e7d6c2fbf50cb642947c78662c6.avif?t=1757351282\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose your car from over fifty unique cars; hit the streets to make deliveries to key clients and gang members.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968650/extras/289dd259702ed136e6322cad2df2e9c0.avif?t=1757351282\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Modify your cars, increase their load capacity, and prepare them for the toughest deliveries on the streets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968650/extras/c88c721aa47d770d052f40c4ee5db670.avif?t=1757351282\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rival gangs aren\u2019t your only problem \u2014 evade the cops, survive, and complete your deliveries without interruption.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968650/extras/c9bb33ccd4c89dfe3ce59b592ada9b42.avif?t=1757351282\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Knock rival gangs off their thrones, level up, seize all territories, and expand your empire with more warehouses to maximize production.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968650/extras/d9e149676c3de36ce61ebe90621bb187.webp?t=1757351282\" width=250 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stay alert while making sales on the dangerous streets; rival gangs are watching you, and everyone is out to claim their share.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968650?t=1757351282","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968650?t=1757351282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968650/6e6882c54aa0c986de187ba7701a0feee7156a15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757351282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968650/6e6882c54aa0c986de187ba7701a0feee7156a15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757351282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968650/extras/50de12f93e89bbc67ecf99ed4dedbc36.poster.avif?t=1757351282\" width=734 height=94 ><source src=\"h